    "body": "Yeah I would assume it's the first ancestor it finds that matches. Also if we did add them for details I suspect most would be external to the details element itself. The ambiguity would exist for commandscope idea though, you could do the first descendant of commandscope that matches but then you could get confusion (though it already exists for label).",
