    "created_at": "2025-08-20T15:20:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-20T15:28:59Z",
    "body": "This is basically exactly the kind of thing I had in mind when I suggested we might [find better solutions](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10143#issuecomment-3160853370) by looking at specific use cases rather than trying to replace/augment IDREFs wholesale.\n\nI like this idea, but before we go too far down this road, might it be nice to have a look at what other IDREF associations could use this style of design, so that we don't end up designing/implementing piecemeal solutions for each one? What are the features of `command` which make this work, and do other other IDREF associations have similar features?\n\nHow would you see this working on the implementation side? How would we ensure the [`aria-details` mapping](https://www.w3.org/TR/html-aam-1.0/#att-command-popovers) is updated at the appropriate time(s)?\n\n> You mean something like this? Not sure. Does this work for implicit label or submit refs?\n\nAs Luke discovered, with `referenceTarget`, as designed it works for implicit label associations: https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/blob/gh-pages/proposals/reference-target-explainer.md#nesting-inside-label\n\nI think we could think about how to explain this type of system working with `referenceTarget` as well.",
