    "updated_at": "2025-08-20T15:29:14Z",
    "body": "> How would you see this working on the implementation side? How would we ensure the aria-details mapping is updated at the appropriate time(s)?\n\nYou'd presumably need dom node removed, inserted and moved steps to recompute this relationship when the command button is moved around, and in turn update stuff like aria-details and aria-expanded. Along with attribute removed steps for popover attribute removal.\n\nUnfortunately I'm not sure aria relationships are specced algorithmically right now so we can't easily codify those steps in a shared place.\n\nI'm assuming *most* of this is already in place. Moved steps would be new though.",
